<title>USA: Southwest Water Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Southwest Water Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>WEST COVINA, Calif. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>FINANCIAL HIGHLIGHTS</p>
<p>				  SOUTHWEST WATER COMPANY</p>
<p>(unaudited)</p>
<p>			  Three Months Ended    Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			     September 30,	  September 30,</p>
<p>			  1996     1995 (a)	 1996     1995 (a)</p>
<p>Operating revenues</p>
<p>		  $18,477,000 $16,848,000 $49,903,000 $41,467,000</p>
